  {
   "_key": "000000000039",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000002e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Experience the wonders of Cairo with a full-day tour that combines Egypt’s ancient artifacts, historic fortresses, and vibrant markets. Begin at the "
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000002f",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Egyptian Museum"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000030",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", home to treasures like Tutankhamun’s golden mask and royal mummies, then journey to the "
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000031",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Saladin Citadel"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000032",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " and its breathtaking "
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000033",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Mosque of Mohamed Ali"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000034",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ". Explore "
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000035",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Al-Muizz Street"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000036",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", Cairo’s historic thoroughfare, lined with grand Islamic monuments, and end your day in the bustling "
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000037",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Khan El Khalili Bazaar"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000038",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " for a true immersion in Cairo’s lively marketplace culture."
    }
   ],
