     "_key": "00000000003c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Comfortable Footwear:"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000003d",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " Wear sturdy and comfortable shoes as the tour involves walking at the Egyptian Museum, Al-Muizz Street, and Khan El Khalili."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000041",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000003f",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Dress Modestly:"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000040",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " Respectful attire is recommended, especially for visits to religious sites such as the Mosque of Mohamed Ali."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000044",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000042",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Weather Considerations:"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000043",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " Carry sunscreen, sunglasses, and a hat to protect against the sun during outdoor visits."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000047",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000045",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Hydration:"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000046",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " Bring a reusable water bottle to stay hydrated throughout the day."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000004a",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000048",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Photography Guidelines:"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000049",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " While photography is allowed at most sites, some locations, such as the Egyptian Museum or certain parts of the Citadel, may have restrictions or require an additional fee."
