    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000004c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " At Khan El Khalili Bazaar, "
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000004e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "00000000004d"
     ],
     "text": "bargaining"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000004f",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " is a common practice and part of the cultural experience, so don’t hesitate to negotiate prices with vendors."
