  {
   "_key": "0000000000a8",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000009f",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Al-Muizz Street"
    },
    {
     "_key": "0000000000a0",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "\n"
    },
    {
     "_key": "0000000000a1",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "From the Citadel, continue to "
    },
    {
     "_key": "0000000000a2",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Al-Muizz Street"
    },
    {
     "_key": "0000000000a3",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", one of Cairo’s oldest and most historically rich avenues. Stroll down this remarkable street lined with beautifully preserved Islamic architecture, including mosques, sabils (water fountains), and madrassas. Highlights include the "
    },
    {
     "_key": "0000000000a4",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Qalawun Complex"
    },
    {
     "_key": "0000000000a5",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " and "
    },
    {
     "_key": "0000000000a6",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Sultan Al-Ghuri Complex"
    },
    {
     "_key": "0000000000a7",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", both testaments to Cairo’s vibrant medieval history. Soak in the ambiance and admire the architectural detail that captures the essence of Islamic Cairo."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "0000000000ac",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0000000000a9",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Lunch at a Local Restaurant"
    },
    {
     "_key": "0000000000aa",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "\n"
    },
    {
     "_key": "0000000000ab",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Take a break and enjoy a traditional Egyptian lunch at a local restaurant. Relish authentic Egyptian dishes in a cozy setting, giving you a chance to relax and reflect on the morning’s experiences."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "0000000000b2",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0000000000ad",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Khan El Khalili Bazaar"
    },
    {
     "_key": "0000000000ae",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "\n"
    },
    {
     "_key": "0000000000af",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Conclude your day at the lively "
    },
    {
     "_key": "0000000000b0",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ],
     "text": "Khan El Khalili Bazaar"
    },
    {
     "_key": "0000000000b1",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", Cairo’s most famous marketplace. This bustling bazaar is filled with vendors selling traditional Egyptian crafts, jewelry, textiles, spices, and souvenirs. Wander through its winding alleys and experience the vibrant marketplace atmosphere, where you can shop for unique mementos and enjoy the rich cultural energy of Cairo."
    }
   ],
